Package: PlayerPredictorMLB
Title: Helps Predict Player Performance in the MLB
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Anthony", "Yaghmour", , "Anthony.Yaghmour@Northwestern.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Package created for MSDS 457 Graduate Course at Northwestern University.
